| The Dominion Forum | Watches Eden for forty minutes and moves from competing to working beside her. Eden notices at once. Four words in the hallway after (TR). | _ |
| Before Endurance | Corinne's trap, and Sera walks into it because she sees too clearly to stay quiet. Judah trades Ruth to keep her (TR). | _ |
| Endurance | Reaches the final checkpoint (TR) | _ |
| After | Advances. The flag is updated, privately (TR). | _ |
